{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04602","headline":"杂诗四首 三 · 张说","name":"杂诗四首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"问子青霞意，何事留朱轩。\n自言心远俗，未始迹辞喧。\n过蒙良时幸，侧息吏途烦。\n簪缨非宿好，文史弃前言。\n夕卧北窗下，梦归南山园。\n白云慙幽谷，清风愧泉源。\n十年兹赏废，佳期今复存。\n挂冠谢朝侣，星驾别君门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04602.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04602","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}